    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>Code &bull; Compete &bull; Conquer</p>\n<p>Competitive Programming is a high-intensity coding challenge where participants compete to solve algorithmic and problem-solving challenges within a limited time. Test your logic, algorithms, data structures, coding efficiency, accuracy, and speed against some of the brightest programmers.</p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to college students across India.</li>\n<li>Individual Participation.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Dates:</strong>&nbsp;16&ndash;17 October 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Venue:</strong>&nbsp;G.L. Bajaj Institute of Technology and Management</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Round 1 &mdash; Coding Challenge</strong></p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Participants will solve a set of programming problems covering:</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Programming Fundamentals</li>\n<li>Data Structures</li>\n<li>Algorithms</li>\n<li>Logical &amp; Mathematical Problems</li>\n<li>Problem-Solving</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Round 2 &mdash; Offline&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Top performers will advance to a higher-difficulty round featuring challenging algorithmic problems.</p>\n<p>Participants will be evaluated based on <strong>problems solved, correctness, efficiency, and time/penalty, depending on the contest format.</strong></p>",
